       "s": "Lift her with care;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Fashion’d so slenderly,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Young, and so fair!",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 907,
     "lines": [
