       "s": "Drips from her clothing;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Take her up instantly,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Loving, not loathing.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 907,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "Touch her not scornfully;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Think of her mournfully,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Gently and humanly;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Not of the stains of her—",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "All that remains of her",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Now is pure womanly.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 907,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "Make no deep scrutiny",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Into her mutiny",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Rash and undutiful:",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Past all dishonour,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Death has left on her",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Only the beautiful.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 907,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "Still, for all slips of hers,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "One of Eve’s family—",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Wipe those poor lips of hers",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Oozing so clammily.",
       "i": 0
      }
